4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vwD8WNvDkTQQ7kNvwF3S0y0&_nc_oc=AdpDMzN_TZTgVIPvGlzlP-GiyV4RbvrdXNHATlJVWeBBbqEZ1Z4Mg_MNDu3wWrw26D0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN1qWBE1w87D5MHSicGDoNsRKVS3WdPIbC-If6m3b34DQ&oe=6AC7CD14"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=__430pZGfeIQ7kNvwHjHFqC&_nc_oc=AdozXYliLopxkZBrlB_fxAt8yUfhuGSmQUPHIFJWIJiOZzSo9k4gq1_teh7N3G6v5io&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPbKPal2d-tIdwjO-MpZvtEiLSh7GDe7QpTsc_h67b1Yw&oe=6AC799B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I-Riljz2CbUQ7kNvwE5ztbp&_nc_oc=AdoXQUKyaBy17GA11DyoOmX3dGBIaZAvnFOQ3vyH6ejq0LH21hY_NeUbWsicppAbG1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPF_1WO9So4JrTJMFEq9kUqYLoJURdXrR02H38_bsHOOg&oe=6AC7A755"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p